#### 5. Eager Test _(Smell 5)_

**Test:** `OrderProcessor_FullWorkflow_Succeeds` (line 52)
**Problem:** Calls **7 distinct production methods** (`ValidateOrder`, `CalculateTotal`, `ApplyDiscount`, `ReserveInventory`, `ProcessPayment`, `SendConfirmation`, `UpdateOrderHistory`). When this test fails, any of the 7 could be the culprit.

